{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/pulls/225","id":4757694921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPqaJu88AAAABG5SpyQ","html_url":"https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/225","diff_url":"https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/225.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/joshyorko/rcc/pull/225.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/issues/225","number":225,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"draft: checkpoint generic Room tree artifact engine","user":{"login":"joshyorko","id":54248591,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MjQ4NTkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54248591?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko","html_url":"https://github.com/joshyorko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshyorko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds a generic Merkle workspace artifact engine beside Environment Artifact v1, with SHA-256 whole-file CAS objects, immutable directory/snapshot objects, trusted explicit dirty-path capture, and changed-branch materialization exposed through RCC's tree-artifact CLI. Existing Environment Artifact manifest/catalog/lease/Drop paths remain unchanged; the shared filesystem constructor retains its existing default behavior.\n\nThis is a checkpoint draft under #118/#125, not a release candidate. Published SHA: b24b29fffab4581456a313a240257d681ad744fd. The implementation tree exactly matches local checkpoint 591771fca0e2977343426f9bf9b918e11e41bc48, tree bf8e8b189d35d16974776f56433e66ceda3a0103. Base: 47a60ea78c5d97c892177f5649a1c950399faa6a. Publication used the connected GitHub API because shell Git credentials were unavailable; local commits and uncommitted helper work were preserved.\n\nValidation completed on Devsy Linux:\n- Focused treeartifact and artifactprovider Go tests, race tests, treeartifact CLI tests, and native RCC build passed at the committed checkpoint.\n- The existing 100,000-file / 2,153,884,204-byte fixture was seeded into 100,252 CAS objects.\n- Route interruption stopped initial materialization before completion. No completed one-dirty-file capture/rematerialization or full correctness receipt is claimed.\n\nMust fix before RC approval:\n- Mode-only materialization currently changes an existing inode and can affect a foreign hardlink.\n- Persistent expected-parent/interrupted-materialization state and multi-process serialization are not yet implemented.\n- Explicit dirty ancestor inconsistencies need fail-closed handling.\n- Inspect CLI, capability/filesystem/trust selector, and conditional-head/provider integration remain incomplete.\n- Additional QA/provider helper code and #125 profiling evidence remain uncommitted locally and are not included in this checkpoint.\n\nNo FICLONE optimization is selected. Plaintext storage requires Josh Room encryption-domain wrapping before product integration. macOS/Windows native execution, platform capability acceptance, full Robot validation, and Dakota Btrfs acceptance are outstanding. NO-GO for promotion. Do not merge/tag/release this draft.","created_at":"2026-10-06T10:55:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T10:55:02Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7b4d8221b369377a1e6381468734406fd6be34f7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joshyorko/rcc/pulls